==========================
BDD Framework Dependencies
==========================

1. Maven Compiler Plugin
   - Compiles Java code
   - Java Version: 1.8

2. Cucumber Core
   - Main Cucumber execution engine

3. Cucumber Java
   - Provides @Given, @When, @Then, @And annotations

4. Cucumber JUnit
   - Executes Cucumber feature files using JUnit

5. Gherkin
   - Parses .feature files (Feature, Scenario, Given, When, Then)

6. Selenium Java
   - Browser automation

7. Cucumber HTML
   - Generates HTML execution reports

8. Cucumber Reporting (Masterthought)
   - Advanced Cucumber reports with charts and statistics

9. Hamcrest Core
   - Assertion matchers

10. Log4j
    - Logging framework

11. Cobertura
    - Code coverage reports

12. Cucumber JVM Deps
    - Legacy internal Cucumber dependency (obsolete)

13. tools.jar (JDK 8)
    - Java internal tools library (obsolete in Java 9+)